  "note": "Test vectors for docs/PROTOCOL.md (M2). Binary values are lowercase hex unless the field name says otherwise. Secret keys here are test keys only. Users alice, bob and carol are the ones of identity.json. Group cases are verified with serverId and chatId of group.json and no previous state unless \"prev\" names a step.",
